  "description": {
    "en": "Luxilon ALU Power is one of the benchmark tour-level polyester tennis strings. Its proprietary poly-ether-ether composition with aluminum additives delivers a distinctive combination of crisp feel, control, power and responsiveness. The string is highly resistant to atmospheric conditions and manufactured with extremely low variance for consistent performance. The 1.15 mm version emphasizes feel and responsiveness, the 1.25 mm version provides the most balanced performance, and the 1.30 mm version emphasizes durability, stability and control.",

    "zh": "Luxilon ALU Power 是职业巡回赛级聚酯球线中的标杆产品之一。其独特的 Poly-Ether-Ether 配方加入铝元素，在清脆击球感、精准控制、力量输出和快速响应之间形成非常鲜明的平衡，同时对湿度等环境条件具有很强的稳定性。1.15毫米版本最强调手感、触球和响应；1.25毫米版本最均衡；1.30毫米版本则更强调耐久、稳定性与方向控制。"
  },

